I2C data line: pull-up resistor, bus capacitance and the target's open-drain pull-down (self-made values)
Vdd vdd 0 DC @VDD@
Rp vdd sda @RP@
Cb sda 0 @CB@ ic=@VINIT@
* The pull-down is an ideal switch with a fixed on-resistance, controlled by a 1 ns ramp.
Vdrv drv 0 PWL(@PWL@)
Sdn sda 0 drv 0 swmod
.model swmod sw vt=0.5 vh=0.1 ron=@RON@ roff=1e12
.options reltol=@RELTOL@ abstol=1e-12 vntol=1e-7 method=@METHOD@ maxord=2
.save v(sda) v(drv)
.end
